  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A microphone M on a moving train detects the sound from a stationary loudspeaker L placed on the track. The track is straight. <br/><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>L emits a sound of constant frequency. The frequency detected by M is continuously decreasing.</p>\n<p>The train is moving <br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">away from L at an increasing speed.</li><li data-label=\"B\">away from L at a constant speed.</li><li data-label=\"C\">towards L at a constant speed.</li><li data-label=\"D\">towards L at an increasing speed.</li></ol>"
  },
